{
    "title": "Smolsies - My Cute Pet House",
    "description": "Meet Smolsies \u2014 the cutest squishy pom-pom creatures and your new adorable virtual pets! Hatch every surprise egg and collect all the pet Smolsies - feed, take care of them and watch your virtual baby animals grow! Merge Smolsies to be able to hatch new super cute fluffy virtual animals, explore their house and play fun mini games!\r\n\r\n<b>HATCH & COLLECT VIRTUAL CUTE PETS</b>\r\nHatch every single surprise egg to collect all the adorable & cute virtual pet baby Smolsies, each one is cuter than the last! Put two pet Smolsies into a magical pet merging machine and get a new surprise egg! Crack it open, let the cute baby Smolsie hatch and discover even more cute virtual pets and collect them all! Hint - there's a fantasy unicorn cat to hatch!\r\n\r\n<b>CARE FOR YOUR VIRTUAL PET</b>\r\nCute baby Smolsies need love, care, and attention! Hatch an egg, feed the baby, clean the house, play games, and watch your cute & fluffy virtual pet grow! Bathe the cute little animals, put them to bed when tired, and create cute DIY hats with adorable pins for your pets to wear!\r\n\r\n<b>PLAY FUN MINI GAMES</b>\r\nAdorable pet Smolsies love playing games! Unlock and enjoy fun jumping, basketball, soccer, coloring, and hat designing mini games! Play to collect virtual coins and win fun and cute gifts for your virtual pet house!\r\n\r\nPlay & hatch Smolsies - the cutest virtual pet care game for kids from the creators of Fluvsies and Kpopsies! Download now to hatch your first adorable surprise egg, take care of cute baby animals, and play fun mini games!\r\n\r\nDiscover more about the Smolsies world:\r\nWEB: smolsiesgame.com \r\nFB: https://www.facebook.com/SmolsiesGame\r\nIG: https://www.instagram.com/smolsiesgame/\r\n\r\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - \r\n\r\nAbout TutoTOONS Games for Kids\r\nCrafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing the games they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experiences to millions of children worldwide.\r\n\r\nImportant Message to Parents\r\nThis app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.\r\n\r\nWant to report an issue or share suggestions? Contact us at support@tutotoons.com\r\n\r\nDiscover More Fun with TutoTOONS!\r\n\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS\r\n\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons\r\n\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
